This bit: "In (function (npt = min(n + 2L, 2L * n), rhobeg = NA, rhoend = NA,  : unused control arguments ignored. "

...should just be a warning which you can ignore:
http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears-warnings-to-ignore-mostly

So, later problems are caused by something else...if you post the error message or email me the files I can try to diagnose.

